This folder builds Orbital Laser 0.5.10 for Horizon on Android from the original source, unchanged: the tag
v0.5.10 (commit 51468c5f69c8f61cb8982a44700853390eb23ed9) of Stink-O/orbital-laser. build.sh fetches it, builds its mod/ crate (Rust, its WGSL
post passes, its build.rs) as a library for aarch64-linux-android against crates/horizon-mod-sdk (the mod SDK the
original targets, for prebuilt mods: mod ABI 4), and packs it with the original content (orbital-laser-mod:
the Designator, its models, textures, laser icons, lang) and sounds (orbital-sounds, synthesized by the original's
tools, no samples) into orbital.hnmod. The only change to the original is the path of its horizon-mod-sdk
dependency.

The game side (crates/horizon-mod-sdk, crates/horizon-client/src/game/sdk_mods.rs and sdk_carry.rs,
crates/horizon-client-render/src/sdk_post) is ported from the original's native/ folder (engine-shim and
mixins/orbital), MIT, Copyright (c) 2026 Stink-O, made generic so any SDK mod runs from its .hnmod.

An independent fan project, not affiliated with or endorsed by Mojang Studios or Microsoft. Nothing from
